The paper’s main body is four pages and the compiled text already reveals a potentially serious interpretation issue: the “quality” axis is explicitly a bundle of topicality, entity density, templates, and code-shaped candidates, not an isolated quality manipulation. I’m now checking whether the prose and claims remain sized to that limitation and whether the PDF layout introduces submission-quality defects.
